ITERATOR-PATTERN.
    MOVE 10 TO VALUE-ITEM(1)
    MOVE 20 TO VALUE-ITEM(2)
    MOVE 30 TO VALUE-ITEM(3)
    PERFORM VARYING INDEX-N FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL INDEX-N > 3
        MOVE VALUE-ITEM(INDEX-N) TO SEEN-ITEM(INDEX-N)
    END-PERFORM
    IF SEEN-ITEM(1) = 10 AND SEEN-ITEM(2) = 20 AND SEEN-ITEM(3) = 30
        PERFORM PASS
    ELSE
        PERFORM FAIL
    END-IF.
